          "content": "Here's something you could send:\n\n\"Hey Jordan, I was just thinking about you today and wanted to say hi. It's been a while since we last talked but I'm still thinking about you. Hope you're doing okay! Let me know when you can talk.\"\n\nThat way you're being open and honest without sounding desperate or clingy. You're just letting Jordan know you're thinking about them and want to catch up, nothing more. It's a good start for a conversation and allows the other person to take the lead from there. I hope it helps! Let me know if you need anything else."
